                                "sense_id": "d41e0330-4b3d-39fa-a537-5ba3812e017d",
                                "text": "\"There's been a misunderstanding, that's all,\" Franklin explained. \"As soon as I get you off of my back, my peoples are gonna start sending out product just like before.\""
